.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**17000**' - services\\n  3. กรณีช่องทางการจ่ายเงิน = 'เช็คบริษัท' หรือ 'อื่นๆ' ให้ทำการ Group by **Service**\\n3. กรณีไม่มีการเลือกประเภทจาก search criteria ให้แสดง service ทั้งหมดจาก [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**17000**'\",\"links\":[{\"text\":\"cf_bank_account_mapping\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping\"},{\"text\":\"cf_bank_account_mapping\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_bank_account_mapping\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"}],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1306854174\",\"title\":\"VAL7 แสดงประเภทการจ่ายที่สัมพันธ์กับช่องทางการจ่าย\",\"url\":\"/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=1306854174\",\"parent\":\"1267073581\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"1.ค้นหาประเภทการจ่ายที่ Mapping ช่องทางการจ่าย [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).config\\nwhere [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog)[.lookup_key =](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header) ช่องทางการจ่าย lookup_key จาก search criteria and [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**61000**' - ประเภทการจ่ายที่ Mapping ช่องทางการจ่าย\\n2. แสดงประเภทการจ่าย\\nwhere [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**15000**' - ประเภทการจ่าย and [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).config = 'Active' and [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).lookup_key = @[cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog)[.](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header)config ที่ได้จากประเภทการจ่ายที่ Mapping ช่องทางการจ่าย\\nกรณีไม่มีการเลือกช่องทางการจ่าย ให้แสดงประเภทการจ่ายทั้งหมดที่ [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**15000**' - ประเภทการจ่าย\",\"links\":[{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\".lookup_key =\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\".\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"}],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1307115936\",\"title\":\"VAL8 แสดงช่องทางการจ่ายที่สัมพันธ์กับประเภทการจ่าย\",\"url\":\"/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=1307115936\",\"parent\":\"1267073581\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"1.ค้นหาประเภทการจ่ายที่ Mapping ช่องทางการจ่าย [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).config\\nwhere [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog)[.lookup_key =](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header) ประเภทการจ่าย config จาก search criteria and [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**61000**' - ประเภทการจ่ายที่ Mapping ช่องทางการจ่าย\\n2. แสดงช่องทางการจ่ายเงิน\\nwhere [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**16000**' - ช่องทางการจ่ายเงิน and [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).lookup_key = @[cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog)[.](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header)lookup_key ที่ได้จากประเภทการจ่ายที่ Mapping ช่องทางการจ่าย\\nกรณีไม่มีการเลือกประเภทการจ่าย ให้แสดงช่องทางการจ่ายทั้งหมดที่ [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**16000**' - ช่องทางการจ่ายเงิน\",\"links\":[{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\".lookup_key =\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\".\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"}],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1313898578\",\"title\":\"VAL9 ตรวจสอบวันที่จากและวันที่ถึง\",\"url\":\"/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=1313898578\",\"parent\":\"1267073581\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"กรณีระบุวันที่จากมากกว่าวันที่ถึง หรือ ระบุเพียงวันที่ใดวันที่หนึ่ง\\nจะแสดงข้อความ \\\"ระบุช่วงวันที่ไม่ถูกต้อง\\\" เป็นตัวอักษรสีแดง ใต้ Text Box\\n-- update by patcha.vo 19/01/69 [https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/44264](https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/44264)\\n-- update by patcha.vo 23/01/69 [https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/45510](https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/45510)\",\"links\":[{\"text\":\"https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/44264\",\"href\":\"https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/44264\"},{\"text\":\"https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/45510\",\"href\":\"https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/45510\"}],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1314652936\",\"title\":\"VAL10 ตรวจสอบการแสดงข้อมูลตาม Version\",\"url\":\"/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=1314652936\",\"parent\":\"1267073581\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"ตรวจสอบการแสดงข้อมูลตาม Version ดังนี้\\n\\n| Phase/Release | [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).config |\\n|---|---|\\n| Ph1R1 | V1 |\\n| Ph1R2 + New Loan Ph1Ph2,Ph3 | V1,V2 |\",\"links\":[{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"}],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1326252490\",\"title\":\"VAL11 แสดง Service ที่สัมพันธ์กับช่องทางการจ่าย (สำหรับรายงาน)\",\"url\":\"/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=1326252490\",\"parent\":\"1267073581\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"1. ค้นหาประเภทการจ่าย จากช่องทางการจ่าย\\n  1. หาข้อมูลประเภทการจ่ายจาก [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).config\\n    1. where [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).lookup_key = @ช่องทางการจ่าย lookup_key จาก search criteria\\n    2. and [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '61000' - ช่องทางการจ่าย Mapping ประเภทการจ่าย\\n  2. หาข้อมูล service จากข้อมูลที่ตาราง [cf_bank_account_mapping](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping).service\\n    1. กรณี [cf_bank_account_mapping](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping).batch_payment_type = 'B' ให้ใช้ payment_channel_type = 'CHEQUE_BANK'\\n    2. [cf_bank_account_mapping](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping).batch_payment_type = [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).config (ประเภทการจ่าย)\\n2. แสดง service จากข้อมูล [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).desciption_eng\\n  1. [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).lookup_key = [cf_bank_account_mapping](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping).service\\n  2. where [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**15000**' - services\\n  3. กรณีช่องทางการจ่ายเงิน = 'เช็คบริษัท' หรือ 'อื่นๆ' ให้ทำการ Group by **Service**\\n3. กรณีไม่มีการเลือกช่องทางการจ่ายจาก search criteria ให้แสดง service ทั้งหมดจาก [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**15000**'\",\"links\":[{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_bank_account_mapping\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping\"},{\"text\":\"cf_bank_account_mapping\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping\"},{\"text\":\"cf_bank_account_mapping\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_bank_account_mapping\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"}],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1328185376\",\"title\":\"VAL12 ตรวจสอบชื่อธุรกรรมที่ถูก Split\",\"url\":\"/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=1328185376\",\"parent\":\"1267073581\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"ตรวจสอบเป็นรายการที่ถูก split ([tx_payment_header_split](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header_split).batch_oper_no)\\n- ให้แสดงชื่อธุรกรรม [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).description where [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).lookup_key = [tx_payment_header](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header).transaction_type + \\\"_\\\" + ต่อด้วยชื่อธนาคาร [tx_payment_header_split](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header_split).split_bank_name\\n- ตัวอย่างเช่น : เงินจ่ายคืนทันที APL/APU_BBL,เงินจ่ายคืนทันที APL/APU_Other\\nกรณีไม่ใช่รายการที่ถูก split\\n- ให้แสดงชื่อธุรกรรม [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).description where [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).lookup_key = [tx_payment_header](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header).transaction_type\",\"links\":[{\"text\":\"tx_payment_header_split\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header_split\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"tx_payment_header\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header\"},{\"text\":\"tx_payment_header_split\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header_split\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"tx_payment_header\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_header\"}],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1329005335\",\"title\":\"VAL13 แสดง Service ที่สัมพันธ์กับช่องทางการจ่าย\",\"url\":\"/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=1329005335\",\"parent\":\"1267073581\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"1. แสดง Service จากการเลือก ช่องทางการจ่าย จาก search criteria\\n  1. หาข้อมูลประเภทการจ่ายจาก [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).lookup_key\\n    1. where [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).lookup_key = @ช่องทางการจ่าย lookup_key จาก search criteria\\n    2. and [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '69000' - ประเภทการจ่าย Mapping Service\\n  2. แสดง Service จากการเลือกช่องทางการจ่าย [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).config\\n2. แสดงชื่อ Service จากข้อมูล [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).desciption_eng\\n  1. [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).lookup_key = [cf_bank_account_mapping](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping).service\\n  2. where [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**15000**' - services\\n  3. กรณีช่องทางการจ่ายเงิน = 'เช็คบริษัท' หรือ 'อื่นๆ' ให้ทำการ Group by **Service**\\n3. กรณีไม่มีการเลือกช่องทางการจ่ายจาก search criteria ให้แสดง service ทั้งหมดจาก [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '**15000**'\",\"links\":[{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_bank_account_mapping\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_bank_account_mapping\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"}],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1335820516\",\"title\":\"VAL14 แสดงกลุ่มธุรกรรมและรายการธุรกรรมที่สัมพันธ์กัน\",\"url\":\"/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=1335820516\",\"parent\":\"1267073581\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"1. กรณีเลือกกลุ่มธุรกรรม [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '13000' - กลุ่มธุรกรรม\\n  1. ให้ตรวจสอบ [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '72000' - กลุ่มธุรกรรม mapping รายการธุรกรรม\\n  2. [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).lookup_key = @transactionGroup\\n  3. แสดง รายการธุรกรรมจาก [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).description_eng\\n2. กรณีเลือกรายการธุรกรรม [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '14000' - รายการธุรกรรม\\n  1. ให้ตรวจสอบ [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).parent_id = '72000' - กลุ่มธุรกรรม mapping รายการธุรกรรม\\n  2. [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).config = @transactionType\\n  3. แสดงกลุ่มธุรกรรมจาก [cf_lookup_catalog](/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).description\",\"links\":[{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"},{\"text\":\"cf_lookup_catalog\",\"href\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog\"}],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1271234854\",\"title\":\"1.Bank Format Code\",\"url\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/1.Bank+Format+Code\",\"parent\":\"1267860406\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"### หลักการระบุเลขที่บัญชี\\n\\nอ้างอิงข้อมูลจาก User : [หลักการระบุเลขที่บัญชี](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1mfuOgWCVcXV5s4NxA6mAb2wbs0dj4fiQ/edit?gid=105484803#gid=105484803) , [สรุปรูปแบบเลขที่บัญชีเงินฝากของธนาคาร (SCB)](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1dA16fwAHaJj-V3B_mKxDm6yhSXOy0cFW/edit?gid=10968996#gid=10968996)\\nอ้างอิง Claim Payment : [หลักการบันทึกรหัสสาขา และเลขที่บัญชีในระบบ SMART(ระบบของธนคารกรุงเทพ)](/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=758415909)\\n\\n| สาขาธนาคาร | หลักการบันทึกรหัสสาขา |\\n|---|---|\\n| รหัสสาขาของธนาคารพาณิชย์ไทยทั่วไป | : ระบุศูนย์และตามด้วยเลขที่บัญชี 3 หลักแรก รวมเป็น 4 หลัก |\\n| รหัสสาขาของธนาคารพาณิชย์ต่างประเทศ | : ระบุ 0001 |\\n| เลขที่บัญชีของธนาคารพาณิชย์ทั่วไป | : ระบุศูนย์และตามด้วยเลขที่บัญชี 10 หลัก รวมเป็น 11 หลัก |\\n\\n| รหัสธนาคารbot_bank_code | ชื่อธนาคาร | จำนวนเลขที่บัญชี | หลักการระบุเลขที่บัญชี 11 หลัก |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| 005 | ธนาคารเอบีเอ็น แอมโร เอ็น.วี. | 6 หลัก | ให้เติม 0 หน้าเลขที่บัญชี 5 หลักเพื่อให้เลขที่บัญชีครบ 11 หลัก |\\n| 010 | ธนาคารแห่งโตเกียว - มิตซูบิชิ จำกัด | 6 หลัก | กรณีเป็นบัญชีกระแสรายวัน (511) ให้ระบุ 11100 หน้าเลขที่บัญชีให้ครบ 11 หลัก กรณีเป็นบัญชีออมทรัพย์ (512) ให้ระบุ 12100 หน้าเลขที่บัญชีให้ครบ 11 หลัก |\\n| 021 | ธนาคารคาลิยง | 14 หลัก | ติดต่อธนาคารคาลิยง เพื่อสอบถามเลขที่บัญชีที่จะให้ระบุ |\\n| 027 | ธนาคารแห่งอเมริกา เนชั่นแนล แอสโซซิเอชั่น | 8 หลัก | ให้เติม 0 หน้าเลขที่บัญชี 3 หลักเพื่อให้เลขที่บัญชีครบ 11 หลัก |\\n| 030 | ธนาคารออมสิน | 15 หลัก | 4 หลักแรกคือรหัสสาขา ส่วน 11 หลักหลังคือเลขที่บัญชี ตัวอย่าง account คือ 96-9602-20-123456-7 วิธีบันทึก รหัสสาขา = 9696 เลขที่บัญชี 02201234567 |\\n| 030 | ธนาคารออมสิน | 12 หลัก | เพิ่มเลข 999 ข้างหน้าและตามด้วยเลขที่บัญชี รวม 15 หลัก ตัวอย่าง account คือ 050011234567 เติม 999 ข้างหน้า ได้เป็น 999050011234567 Branch = 9990 (4 หลักแรก) Account = 50011234567 (11 หลัก) |\\n| 031 | ธนาคารฮ่องกงและเซี่ยงไฮ้ จำกัด | 12 หลัก | เลขที่บัญชีจะขึ้นต้นด้วย 001 หรือ 002 ให้ลบศูนย์หลักแรกของเลขที่บัญชีเพื่อให้เหลือ 11 หลัก |\\n| 033 | ธนาคารอาคารสงเคราะห์ | 12 หลัก | 3 หลักแรกคือรหัสสาขา ส่วน 9 หลักหลังคือเลขที่บัญชี ให้เติม 0 หน้าเลขที่บัญชีให้ครบ 11 หลัก ตัวอย่าง account คือ 001-11-012345-6 วิธีบันทึก รหัสสาขา = 0001 เลขที่บัญชี 00110123456 |\\n| 034 | ธนาคารเพื่อการเกษตรและสหกรณ์การเกษตร | 12 หลัก | ให้หัก 0 ออกจำนวน 1 หลัก จะเหลือ 11 หลัก ตัวอย่าง account คือ 012345678901 (รหัสสาขา ดูตามสมุด) = (Account = 12345678901)รหัสสาขา Fix : 0000 (updated by patcha.vo 17/03/69 [https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/57429](https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/57429)) |\\n| 067 | ธนาคารทิสโก้ จำกัด (มหาชน) | 14 หลัก | 4 หลักแรกคือรหัสสาขา ส่วน 10 หลักหลังคือเลขที่บัญชี ให้เติม 0 หน้าเลขที่บัญชี เพื่อให้เลขที่บัญชีครบ 11 หลัก |\\n| 069 | ธนาคารเกียรตินาคิน | 14 หลัก | 4 หลักแรกคือรหัสสาขา ส่วน 10 หลักหลังคือเลขที่บัญชี ให้เติม 0 หน้าเลขที่บัญชี เพื่อให้เลขที่บัญชีครบ 11 หลัก |\\n| 018 | ธนาคารซูมิโตโม มิตซุย แบงค์คอร์ปอเรชั่น | 10 หลัก | ให้เติม 0 หน้าเลขที่บัญชี 3 หลักเพื่อให้เลขที่บัญชีครบ 11 หลัก |\\n| 039 | ธนาคารมิซูโฮ คอร์เปอเรต สาขากรุงเทพฯ | 12 หลัก | 12 หลัก เช่น H12345678901 ระบุรหัสสาขาคือ 0001 เลขที่บัญชี 11 หลัก คือ 12345678901(ตัด H ออก) |\\n| 066 | ธนาคารอิสลามแห่งประเทศไทย | 10 หลัก และ 12 หลัก | 1) กรณี บัญชีมี 12 หลัก ขึ้นต้นด้วย 89 ให้ลบ 89 ออกไป เหลือ 10 หลัก เติม “0” ด้านหน้า 1 ตัว 2) กรณี 12 หลัก ตัด 89 ออกแล้วเติม “0” ด้านหน้า 1 ตัว |\",\"links\":[{\"text\":\"หลักการระบุเลขที่บัญชี\",\"href\":\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1mfuOgWCVcXV5s4NxA6mAb2wbs0dj4fiQ/edit?gid=105484803#gid=105484803\"},{\"text\":\"สรุปรูปแบบเลขที่บัญชีเงินฝากของธนาคาร (SCB)\",\"href\":\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1dA16fwAHaJj-V3B_mKxDm6yhSXOy0cFW/edit?gid=10968996#gid=10968996\"},{\"text\":\"หลักการบันทึกรหัสสาขา และเลขที่บัญชีในระบบ SMART(ระบบของธนคารกรุงเทพ)\",\"href\":\"/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=758415909\"},{\"text\":\"https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/57429\",\"href\":\"https://redmine.ochi.link/issues/57429\"}],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1271234850\",\"title\":\"2.Encrypt File\",\"url\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/2.Encrypt+File\",\"parent\":\"1267860406\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"อ้างอิงข้อมูล : [สรุป Encrypt file](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1PNzle-Pp7CcNFVuNokq1mcNzIzK2Xsq_/edit?gid=71962653#gid=71962653)\\n\\n| No. | ธนาคาร | วิธีการเข้ารหัสไฟล์ของธนาคาร | Function/ Algorithm | Link Program | Public Key | Service | Golive ปัจจุบัน - เดือน 7 | Golive เดือน 9 |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| 1 | TTB | Encryption | PGP | - | [TTB.asc](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SdxqPp9hY2jV_B_xB_ViiyvC6Dq3Dut8/view?usp=drive_link) | TTB | ไม่ Encrypt File | Encrypt File |\\n| 2 | KTB | Encryption | PGP | - | [KTB.asc](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LN-JhhPTb5Qwq1k_T006q0Jh195fwTLl/view?usp=drive_link) | KTB_PAY | ไม่ Encrypt File |\\n| 3 | BBL | Encryption Through Program | - | POC จาก Program Encrypt[Link Program](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1PNzle-Pp7CcNFVuNokq1mcNzIzK2Xsq_/edit?gid=1214790146#gid=1214790146)AESEncrypter.jar | - | BBL_MCL | Encrypt File |\\n| BBL_E_WHT |\\n| BBL_PP_ID |\\n| BBL_PAY |\\n| 4 | SCBT | Encryption Through Program | - | POC จาก Program Encrypt[Link Program](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1g1cIKo56BbBjiFeb4BmAkyN-tQ_hRl5A/view)e-Revenuepassword : *Scbt020 | - | CHE_SCBT | ไม่ Encrypt File |\\n| 5 | KBANK | Hash | MD5 | - | - | KB_PAY | Encrypt File |\\n| 6 | SCB | Hash | POC จาก Program Run Hash[Link Program](https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1K09188plmtuoyyCV5SgUzmXTg5kwRsxA) SCBBCMHash.batpassward : scb1235 | - | - | SCB_DIR | Encrypt File |\\n| SCB_ORFT |\",\"links\":[{\"text\":\"สรุป Encrypt file\",\"href\":\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1PNzle-Pp7CcNFVuNokq1mcNzIzK2Xsq_/edit?gid=71962653#gid=71962653\"},{\"text\":\"TTB.asc\",\"href\":\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SdxqPp9hY2jV_B_xB_ViiyvC6Dq3Dut8/view?usp=drive_link\"},{\"text\":\"KTB.asc\",\"href\":\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LN-JhhPTb5Qwq1k_T006q0Jh195fwTLl/view?usp=drive_link\"},{\"text\":\"Link Program\",\"href\":\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1PNzle-Pp7CcNFVuNokq1mcNzIzK2Xsq_/edit?gid=1214790146#gid=1214790146\"},{\"text\":\"Link Program\",\"href\":\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1g1cIKo56BbBjiFeb4BmAkyN-tQ_hRl5A/view\"},{\"text\":\"Link Program\",\"href\":\"https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1K09188plmtuoyyCV5SgUzmXTg5kwRsxA\"}],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1271235227\",\"title\":\"3. เงื่อนไขการส่งข้อมูลจ่ายเงิน\",\"url\":\"/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=1271235227\",\"parent\":\"1267860406\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"| Format File | Limit Amount/Transaction | Limit Amount/Batch | Limit Transaction/Batch | หมายเหตุ |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| BBL_MCL = โอนเงินปกติ | 2,000,000.00 | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 3,000 | Limit Amount/Batch ตาม format file ของธนาคาร |\\n| BBL_e-WHT = โอนเงินแบบมี e-WHT(รพ) | 2,000,000.00 | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 3,000 | Limit Amount/Batch ตาม format file ของธนาคาร |\\n| BBL_PromptPay_ID = โอนเงินเข้าบัญชีพร้อมเพย์ | 2,000,000.00 | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 3,000 | Limit Amount/Batch ตาม format file ของธนาคาร |\\n| SCBT = โอนเงินแบบมี WHT(รพ) | 2,000,000.00 | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 1,000 |   |\\n| BBL_Payroll = โอนเงินให้ตัวแทนใช้บัญชี BBL | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 3,000 | Limit Amount/Transaction และ Limit Amount/Batch ตามformat file ของธนาคาร |\\n| KB_Payroll = โอนเงินให้ตัวแทนใช้บัญชี KB | 9,999,999,999.99 | 100,000,000,000,000.00 | 3,000 | Limit Amount/Transaction และ Limit Amount/Batch ตามformat file ของธนาคาร |\\n| KTB_Payroll = โอนเงินให้ตัวแทนใช้บัญชี KTB | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 60,000,000.00 | 3,000 | Limit Amount/Transaction ตามformat file ของธนาคาร |\\n| SCB_Direct = โอนเงินด่วน บัญชีปลายทาง SCB | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 10,000 | Limit Amount/Transaction และ Limit Amount/Batch ตาม format file ของธนาคาร |\\n| SCB_ORFT = โอนเงินด่วน บัญชีปลายทาง Other | LIMIT_ORFT* | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 50 | Limit Amount/Transaction ตาม Sheet LIMIT_ORFT Limit Amount/Batch ตาม format file ของธนาคาร**ชื่อธนาคาร****Receiving Amount Condition***002-BBL<= 2,000,000006-KTB<= 2,000,000011-TTB<= 2,000,000017 - Corporate<=699,999.00017- Retail Customer<=699,999.00018-SMBC<=699,999.00020-SCBT<=2,000,000022-CIMBT<=699,999.00024-UOB<=699,999.00025-BAY<=2,000,000030-GSB<=2,000,000033-GHB<=699,999.00034-BAAC<=699,999.00039-MHCB<=2,000,000066-IBANK<=999,999.99067-TISCO<=2,000,000069-KKB<=2,000,000070-ICBC<=2,000,000071-TCRB<=2,000,000073-LHBA<=2,000,000 |\\n| **ชื่อธนาคาร** | **Receiving Amount Condition*** |\\n| 002-BBL | <= 2,000,000 |\\n| 006-KTB | <= 2,000,000 |\\n| 011-TTB | <= 2,000,000 |\\n| 017 - Corporate | <=699,999.00 |\\n| 017- Retail Customer | <=699,999.00 |\\n| 018-SMBC | <=699,999.00 |\\n| 020-SCBT | <=2,000,000 |\\n| 022-CIMBT | <=699,999.00 |\\n| 024-UOB | <=699,999.00 |\\n| 025-BAY | <=2,000,000 |\\n| 030-GSB | <=2,000,000 |\\n| 033-GHB | <=699,999.00 |\\n| 034-BAAC | <=699,999.00 |\\n| 039-MHCB | <=2,000,000 |\\n| 066-IBANK | <=999,999.99 |\\n| 067-TISCO | <=2,000,000 |\\n| 069-KKB | <=2,000,000 |\\n| 070-ICBC | <=2,000,000 |\\n| 071-TCRB | <=2,000,000 |\\n| 073-LHBA | <=2,000,000 |\\n| Bank Cheque_SCBT = จ่ายเช็คธนาคาร AP | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 1,000 |   |\\n| Bank Cheque_UOB = จ่ายเช็คธนาคาร | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 10,000,000,000,000.00 | 1,000 |   |\",\"links\":[],\"atts\":[]},{\"id\":\"1285096019\",\"title\":\"Bank Cheque_SCBT\",\"url\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/Bank+Cheque_SCBT\",\"parent\":\"1267860406\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"| File Type | .csv |\\n|---|---|\\n| Data Padding | ไม่มี |\\n| ตัวอย่างไฟล์และคำอธิบาย | [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FvH4S59AzWQndIgqrhOH65DNLH6BmU_E](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FvH4S59AzWQndIgqrhOH65DNLH6BmU_E) |\\n\\n| Column | Field name | Mandatory | Length | Description | Example | Mapping |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **Header** |\\n| A | Record Type | Y | 1 |   |   | Fix : H |\\n| B | File Type | Y | 1 |   |   | Fix : P |\\n| **Payment Detail [List]** |\\n| A | Record Type * | Y | X(1) | Mandatory. If invalid, reject whole file. |   | Fix : P |\\n| B | Payment Type * | Y | X(4) | TT = Telegraphic Transfer (การโอนเงินต่างประเทศ ) RTGS = Local Bank Transfer (Baht Net)(การโอนเงินภายในประเทศ) ACH=Direct Credit (การโอนเงินภายในประเทศ) BT= Book Transfer (การโอนเงินภายในระหว่างบัญชี) PAY= Pay Roll (การโอนเงิน) LBC = Local Bank Cheque การจ่ายเงินผ่าน cashier cheques |   | Fix : LBC |\\n| C | Processing Mode | Y | X(2) | \\\"ON\\\" for TT, RTGS,BT \\\"BA\\\" for ACH, LBC & PAY |   | Fix : BA |\\n| D | Service Type | Y | X(2) | If wrong, still allow the transaction to go to 'Incomplete' status. But under Edit/Complete, do not allow to complete until correct value is selected. Currently, mandatory for TH ACH and PAY Payment Type. Not applicable for remaining countries and Payment Types. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| E | Customer Reference | N | X(35) | For SWIFT payment centres, .if specified, must be unique customer reference within the customer group, if not unique, reject whole file. . If start or end with '/' or contains '//' the import as incomplete . If If empty, system will default a unique customer reference as complete. |   | [tx_payment_detail](/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).transaction_no |\\n| F | Customer Memo | N | X(255) | No local language supported. No validation. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| G | Debit A/C Country Code * | Y | X(2) | Mandatory. If invalid, reject whole file. ('US' for US account, 'GB' for UK account) |   | Fix : TH |\\n| H | Debit A/C City Code * | Y | X(3) | Mandatory. If invalid, reject whole file. ('NY' for US account, 'LDN' for UK account) |   | Fix : BKK |\\n| I | Debit A/C No. * | Y | X(34) | Mandatory. If invalid, reject whole file. |   | แสดง [cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).description โดยไม่แสดง -[cf_lookup_catalog](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/cf_lookup_catalog).lookup_key = [tx_batch_payment](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_batch_payment).bank_account_codewhere parent_id = **18000** |\\n| J | Payment/Value Date * | Y | X(10) | Mandatory. Back value date is valid for SWIFT payment centres. If invalid, reject whole file. |   | [tx_batch_payment](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_batch_payment).paid_date |\\n| K | Payee/Beneficiary Name in BO* | Y | X(96) | Support up to 96 characters for RTGS payment type of MY-KUL payment centre. English only. Support up to 70 chacters for ACH payment type of ID-JKT payment centre. For non-SWIFT payment centres, English only. Not a critical field. For SWIFT payment centres, if payee/beneficiary type is : SW, FW, CH, CP, SC see field 20 : AC, TX if null & invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete. |   | คำนำหน้า [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).payee_short_titleชื่อ [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).payee_first_nameนามสกุล [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).payee_last_nameแสดงเฉพาะตัวอักษรตำแหน่งที่ 1-96 |\\n| L | Payee Address1 in BO* | Y | X(35) | English only. Not a critical field. (See Field 20) |   | [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).tax_address1 + [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).tax_address2แสดงเฉพาะตัวอักษรตำแหน่งที่ 1-35 |\\n| M | Payee Address2 in BO* | Y | X(35) | English only. Not a critical field. (See Field 20) |   | [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).tax_address1 + [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).tax_address2แสดงเฉพาะตัวอักษรตำแหน่งที่ 36-70 |\\n| N | Payee Country Code | Y | X(35) | Mandatory for TT. 2 char |   | Fix : TH |\\n| O | Payee Fax Number* | N | X(16) | Not a critical field. Not applicable to SWIFT payment centres. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| P | Payee/Beneficiary Bank Code* | Y | X(11) | For non-SWIFT payment centre, supports only 11 characters. If Bank code is blank but clearing code is not blank, then check clearing code exists in STS bank table (DS_BANK_PYTM_CTR_MAPPING), if not exists then error otherwise assign bank code based on clearing code. For SWIFT payment centres supports up to 34 characters. If beneficiary bank type is : 'SW' - if not found in SWIFT table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address. If found in SWIFT table overwrite Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address with values in SWIFT table and import as Complete. : 'CH' - if not found in CHIPSUID table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address. if found in CHIPSUID table overwrite Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address with values in CHIPSUID table and import as Complete. : 'CP' - if not found in CHIPSABA table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address. if found in CHIPSABA table overwrite Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address with values in CHIPSABA table and import as Complete. : 'FW' - if not found in FEDWIRE table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address. if found in FEDWIRE table overwrite Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address with values in FEDWIRE table and import as Complete. : 'SC' - if not found in CHAPS table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address. if found in CHAPS table overwrite Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address with values in CHAPS table and import as Complete. : 'AC' - if empty, import transaction as incomplete, if not null, import as Complete. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete. : 'TX' - this field will be imported as null. If payee/beneficiary type (field 64) = 'CH' and Payee/Beneficiary Bank Type (field 65) <> 'CP' then import payment as incomplete with Payee/Beneficiary Bank Type = 'CP' and update Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank name & address as null If payee/beneficiary type (field 64) = 'CH' and Payee/Beneficiary Bank Type (field 65) = 'CP', check if record found in CHIPS LINK table using Payee/Beneficiary A/C no (field 20) & Payee/Beneficiary Bank Code (field 16). If found, import as complete. If not found, import as incomplete with with Payee/Beneficiary Bank Type = 'CP' and update Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank name & address as null |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| Q | Payee bank local clearing code* | Y | X(17) | This field would be used to fetch the Payee Bank Code (field 16) if Payee Bank Code is not available in file. Not applicable only for SWIFT payment centres |   | [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).bot_bank_code |\\n| R | Payee branch code* | N | X(5) | If wrong, still allow the transaction to go to 'Incomplete' status. But under Edit/Complete, do not allow to complete until correct value is selected. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres |   | ตรวจสอบการระบุรหัสสาขาตามเงื่อนไขของแต่ละธนาคาร [Bank Format Code](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/1.Bank+Format+Code)[tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).bank_account_no |\\n| S | Payee branch sub-code* | N | X(3) | If wrong, still allow the transaction to go to 'Incomplete' status. But under Edit/Complete, do not allow to complete until correct value is selected. Currently only applicable for ID-JKT payment centre. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| T | Payee/Beneficiary A/C No.* | Y | X(34) | Invalid SWIFT char validation. If wrong, let the transaction go to 'Incomplete' status and under Edit screen do not allow to Complete. For SWIFT payment centre and payee id specified (field 62) is not found in the payee table, then if payee/beneficiary type is : 'SW' - if not found in SWIFT table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Payee A/C no., Payee/Beneficiary Name in BO*, Payee Address 1 to 3. if found in SWIFT table overwrite Payee/Beneficiary Name in BO*, Payee Address 1 to 3 with values in SWIFT table and import as Complete. : 'CH' - if not found in CHIPSUID table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Payee A/C no., Payee/Beneficiary Name in BO*, Payee Address 1 to 3. if found in CHIPSUID table overwrite Payee/Beneficiary Name in BO*, Payee Address 1 to 3 with values in CHIPSUID table and import as Complete. : 'CP' - if not found in CHIPSABA table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Payee A/C no., Payee/Beneficiary Name in BO*, Payee Address 1 to 3. if found in CHIPSABA table overwrite Payee/Beneficiary Name in BO*, Payee Address 1 to 3 with values in CHIPSABA table and import as Complete. : 'FW' - if not found in FEDWIRE table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Payee A/C no., Payee/Beneficiary Name in BO*, Payee Address 1 to 3. if found in FEDWIRE table overwrite Payee/Beneficiary Name in BO* , Payee Address 1 to 3 with values in FEDWIRE table import as complete. : 'SC' - if not found in CHAPS table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Payee A/C no., Payee/Beneficiary Name in BO*, Payee Address 1 to 3. if found in CHAPS table overwrite Payee/Beneficiary Name in BO*, Payee Address 1 to 3 with values in CHAPS table and import as Complete. : 'AC' - if null or invalid SWIFT, import transaction as incomplete, if not null, import as Complete. : 'TX' - this field will be imported as null. For IBFT Pay-to-Proxy (P2P) payments of MY-KUL payment centre, provide the Proxy ID value. For IBFT payment type “pay to proxy” of MY-KUL payment centre, provide the proxy ID value in this field with proxy ID type provided in Field 43 (Beneficiary Identification Type). For Pay To Mobile proxy type, mobile number along with Dial code must be provided in the format as \\\"Dial Code - Mobile Number\\\" i.e. 60-90030334 with the separator \\\"-\\\".Client need not provide prefix \\\"+\\\". If client provides Dial In codes with zeros Eg: 0060 via bulk import, then leading zeros will be removed and validated. i.e. 60. For the proxy type \\\"Passport Number\\\", the Passport Number & the Nationality of the passport in ISO 3-digit Alpha code must be provided jointly as a single value with the separator \\\"-\\\".For e.g: if the Passport Number is “G12345678” and the Nationality of the passport is selected as “Singapore -SGP”, then the value must be provided as \\\"G12345678-SGP\\\" For ACH/PAY/IBFT Pay-to-Proxy (AnyID) payments of TH-BKK payment centre, provide the Proxy ID value. |   | ตรวจสอบการระบุเลขบัญชีตามเงื่อนไขของแต่ละธนาคาร [Bank Format Code](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/1.Bank+Format+Code)[tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).bank_account_no |\\n| U | Payment Details1 in BO | N | X(70) | English only. Not a critical field. SWIFT validation for TT,also MCP allowed Cheques. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| V | Payment Details2 in BO | N | X(70) | English only. Not a critical field. SWIFT validation for TT,also MCP allowed Cheques. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).tax_no |\\n| W | VAT Amount | N | 9(12).9(2) | Numeric check. If VAT type is provided and amount is not > 0, calculate from VAT table. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| X | WHT Printing Location | N | X(1) | If wrong, still allow the transaction to go to 'Incomplete' status. But under Edit/Complete, do not allow to complete until correct value is selected. Currently applicable only for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | Fix : H |\\n| Y | WHT Form ID | N | X(2) | If wrong, still allow the transaction to go to 'Incomplete' status. But under Edit/Complete, do not allow to complete until correct value is selected. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).wht_type |\\n| Z | WHT TaxID* | N | X(13) | If wrong, still allow the transaction to go to 'Incomplete' status. But under Edit/Complete, do not allow to complete until correct value is selected. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).tax_no |\\n| AA | WHT Reference Number | N | X(6) | If wrong, still allow the transaction to go to 'Incomplete' status. But under Edit/Complete, do not allow to complete until correct value is selected. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AB | WHT Type1 | N | X(3) | Currently, applicable only to TH-BKK payment centre. If provided, must be valid WHT in WHT Table, else reject file. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AC | WHT Description1 | N | X(35) | No local language supported. No special validation. Local language support for STS countries, 35 characters supported regardless of the language. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AD | WHT Gross Amount1 | N | 9(12).9(2) | Numeric check. If WHT type 1 is provided and amount is not > 0, then default to Invoice Amount. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).gross_amount |\\n| AE | WHT Amount1 | N | 9(12).9(2) | Numeric check. If WHT type 1 is provided and amount is not > 0, then calculate from WHT table. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).wht_amount |\\n| AF | WHT Type2 | N | X(3) | Currently, applicable only to TH-BKK payment centre. If provided, must be valid WHT in WHT Table, else reject file. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AG | WHT Description2 | N | X(35) | No local language supported. No special validation. Local language support for STS countries, 35 characters supported regardless of the language. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AH | WHT Gross Amount2 | N | 9(12).9(2) | Numeric check. If WHT type 2 is provided and amount is not > 0, then default to Invoice Amount. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AI | WHT Amount2 | N | 9(12).9(2) | Numeric check. If WHT type 2 is provided and amount is not > 0, then calculate from WHT table. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AJ | Discount Amount | N | 9(12).9(2) | Numeric check. If Discount type is provided and amount is not > 0, calculate from Discount table. Currently only applicable for TH-BKK payment centre. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AK | Invoice Format | N | X(1) | If blank, default to 4. Not applicable to SWIFT payment centres. Values A to I are for custom invoice where A = 2 columns, B = 3 columns….I = 10 columns |   | Fix : 4 |\\n| AL | Payment Currency * | Y | X(3) | Mandatory. If invalid, reject whole file. For SWIFT payments, . if payeetype or payeebanktype or interbanktype = CH, CP, FW and payment currency <> USD, import as incomplete. . If payeetype or payeebanktype or interbanktype = SC and payment currency <> GBP import as incomplete |   | Fix : THB |\\n| AM | Payment amount * | Y | N(12.3) | No change in Amount length as part of Indonsia requiremenr. Mandorty. Numeric check and greater than 0. If invalid, reject the file. |   | [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).amount |\\n| AN | Local charges to | N | X(1) | If invalid default to C |   | Fix : C |\\n| AO | Overseas charges to | N | X(1) | For TT and MCP TT. C=Customer/OUR, P=Payee/BEN. Otherwise, default to P. For SWIFT payment centres only, additional option S=Shared is available. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AP | Intermediary bank code* | N | X(11) | For non SWIFT payement centres, if Intermediary bank code is not blank, check whether the code exists in STS bank table (DS_BANK_PYMT_CTR_MAPPING), if not error. Length allowed 11 characters. For SWIFT payment centres supports up to 34 characters. If beneficiary bank type is : 'SW' - if not found in SWIFT table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address. If found in SWIFT table overwrite Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address with values in SWIFT table and import as Complete. : 'CH' - if not found in CHIPSUID table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address. if found in CHIPSUID table overwrite Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address with values in CHIPSUID table and import as Complete. : 'CP' - if not found in CHIPSABA table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address. if found in CHIPSABA table overwrite Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address with values in CHIPSABA table and import as Complete. : 'FW' - if not found in FEDWIRE table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address. if found in FEDWIRE table overwrite Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address with values in FEDWIRE table and import as Complete. : 'SC' - if not found in CHAPS table, import transaction as incomplete with blank values in Beneficiary Bank Code, Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address. if found in CHAPS table overwrite Beneficiary Bank Name, Beneficiary Address with values in CHAPS table and import as Complete. : 'AC' - if empty, import transaction as incomplete, if not null, import as Complete. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete. : 'TX' - this field will be imported as null. If payee/beneficiary bank type (field 65) = 'CH' and Intermediary Bank Type (field 68) <> 'CP' then import payment as incomplete with Intermediary Bank Type = 'CP' and update Interemdiary Bank Code, Intermediary Bank name & address as null If payee/beneficiary bank type (field 65) = 'CH' and Intermediary Bank Type (field 68) = 'CP', check if record found in CHIPS LINK table using Payee/Beneficiary bank code (field 16) & Intermediary Bank Code (field 42). If found, import as complete. If not found, import as incomplete with with Intermediary Bank Type = 'CP' and update Intermediary Bank Code, Intermediary Bank name & address as null |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AQ | Clearing Code for TT* | N | X(140) | No special validation. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. Local Language not allowed. When bank code is selected then correct bank details need to be enetered in this field |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AR | Clearing Zone Code for LBC and XCHQ | N | X(2) | If wrong, still allow the transaction to go to 'Incomplete' status. But under Edit/Complete, do not allow to complete until correct value is selected. Applicable only for LBC and XCHQ |   | Fix : BK |\\n| AS | Drawee bank code for IBC | N | X(11) | If wrong, still allow the transaction to go to 'Incomplete' status. But under Edit/Complete, do not allow to complete until correct value is selected. Applicable only for IBC. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AT | Delivery Method | N | X(1) | If wrong, default to current default being defined. Applicable only for LBC/IBC/CC. |   | Fix : Pupdated by patcha.vo 08/06/69 |\\n| AU | Deliver to | N | X(1) | If wrong, default to current default being defined. Applicable only for LBC/IBC/CC. |   | Fix : Pupdated by patcha.vo 08/06/69 |\\n| AV | Counter Pickup Location | N | X(3) | If wrong, still allow the transaction to go to 'Incomplete' status. But under Edit/Complete, do not allow to complete until correct value is selected. |   | Fix : SCBupdated by patcha.vo 08/06/69 |\\n| AW | FX Type | Y/NXML | X(1) | If payment currency and debit currency are same, default to 'O' and consider as valid. If the payment currency and debit currency are different and FX type is 'L' or wrong, then the transaction will be Incomplete with 'Awaiting FX' status. For SWIFT payment centres, if 'S', then apply rates from global fx rates (RDS). FX Type is not applicable for payment type CA or RSPC For MCP Payments not allowed if given will throw error. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| AX | Payee Name Line 1 (local Language)* | N | X(80) | Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 80 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | คำนำหน้า [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).payee_short_titleชื่อ [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).payee_first_nameupdated by patcha.vo 08/06/69 |\\n| AY | Payee Name Line 2 (local Language)* | N | X(80) | Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 80 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | นามสกุล [tx_payment_detail](http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_payment_detail).payee_last_nameupdated by patcha.vo 08/06/69 |\\n| AZ | Payee Address 1 (local language)* | N | X(80) | Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 80 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BA | Payee Address 2 (local language)* | N | X(80) | Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 80 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BB | Payee Address 3 (local language)* | N | X(80) | Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 80 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BC | Payee Address 4 (local language)* | N | X(80) | Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 80 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BD | payment detail 1 (local language) | N | X(70) | Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 70 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. For CH-SHA, this field will be overwritten with payment detials stored in the payee table if imported with payee id |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BE | payment detail 2 (local language) | N | X(70) | Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 70 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. For CH-SHA, this field will be overwritten with payment detials stored in the payee table if imported with payee id |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BF | Vat Type | N | X(3) | Currently, applicable only to TH-BKK payment centre. If provided, must be valid WHT in WHT Table, else reject file. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BG | Discount Type | N | X(3) | If provided, must be valid Discount type in Discount table. Currently, applicable only to TH-BKK payment centre. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BH | Debit Currency | Y/NXML | X(3) | If not provide, default based on Account number and payment centre, if more than one record found transaction will be imported as Incomplete.Mandatory for MCP Payments if not given will throw error |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BI | Debit Bank Id | N | X(11) | If not provide, default based on Account number and payment centre, if more than one record found during default, transaction will be imported as Incomplete |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BJ | Payee ID | N | X(35) | If provided and the payee ID is found in the Payee Table, the payee details (fields marked by * in the import format) will be overwritten by values in the Payee Table. If Payee ID provided cannot be found in the Payee Table, payee details from import file will be imported. For SWIFT payment centres, if valid Payee id is found in the Payee Table, the following validation needs to be done: For TT and MCP TT, Payee/Beneficiary Type must be AC, TX or CH and Beneficiary Bank Type is not null, as import as incomplete For CA or RSPC, Payee/Beneficiary Type must be TX, else import as incomplete. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BK | Emailid | N | X(255) | Beneficiary Email id. Not applicable to SWIFT TT. Email address validation, format must be user@domain |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BL | Payee/Beneficiary Type* | N | X(2) | Default to 'AC' if not provided. If anything other than 'AC' is specified for non SWIFT payment centre, default to 'AC' and import as complete. Mandatory for SWIFT payment centre, if not there, import as incomplete. If Payment Type (field 2) is : TT and MCP TT, then only CH, AC, TX is valid, if invalid import as null and incomplete : CA, RSPC, then only TX is valid, if invalid, import as null and incomplete : BB, then CH, AC, SW, CP, FW, SC, TX are valid, if invalid, import as null and incomplete |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BM | Beneficiary Bank Type* | N | X(2) | If Payment Type (field 2) is : TT and MCP TT if null or invalid import payee/beneficiary type, payee/beneficiary name in BO, payee address 1 to 3 as null and incomplete : CA, RSPC, then only TX is valid, if null or invalid, import payee/beneficiary type, payee/beneficiary name in BO, payee address 1 to 3 as null and incomplete : BB, then CH, AC, SW, CP, FW, SC, TX are valid, if null or invalid, import as payee/beneficiary type, payee/beneficiary name in BO, payee address 1 to 3 as null and incomplete |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BN | Beneficiary Bank Name* | N | X(35) | For SWIFT payment centres only. if payee/beneficiary type is : SW, FW, CH, CP, SC see field 16 (populate this field based on payee/beneficiary bank codes) : AC, TX if null & invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BO | Beneficiary Bank Addr* | N | X(105) | For SWIFT payment centres only. if payee/beneficiary type is : SW, FW, CH, CP, SC see field 16 (populate this field based on payee/beneficiary bank codes) : AC, TX if invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete (this field can be null) |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BP | Intermediary Bank Type* | N | X(2) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres. If null but intermediary bank code, intermediary bank name or addr is not null, import as incomplete if invalid, reject file with error |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BQ | Intermediary Bank Name* | N | X(35) | For SWIFT payment centres only. If intermediary bank type = TX or AC and Intermediary bank name is null, import as incomplete |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BR | Intermediary Bank Addr* | N | X(105) | For SWIFT payment centres only. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BS | Receiver Corresponding Bank Code* | N | X(11) | For SWIFT payment centres only. If specified, must be valid SWIFT bank code in SWIFT table. If invalid, reject file with error. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BT | Ordering Customer | N | X(140) | No More in Use. Use the individual OBO fields |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BU | Related Information | N | X(16) | For BB only. If Invalid SWIFT or it starts and ends with '/' or have 2 consecutive '//', import as Incomplete. If null, import as 'NONREF' |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BV | Specical instruction Code 1 | N | X(8) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres. If pay type = TT or CA, valid values are ACC, INS, INT, REC If pay type = BB, valid values are ACC, BNF, INS, INT, PHON, PHONBEN, PHONIBK, REC, TELE, TELEBEN, TELEIBK Not valid for pay type = RSPC If invalid code word, reject file with error if FX Type = 'C' and if there are 5 or 6 sets of instruction codes defined in import file, import as incomplete |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BW | Specical instruction Detail 1 | N | X(33) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres, pay type TT, BB, CA only. If Special Instrcution code 1 is null and Special instrcution detail 1 is not null, invalid and reject file. If special instruction code 1 = ACC, INS, INT, REC, BNF, then special instruction detail 1 cannot exceed 30 characters. If special instruction code 1 = PHON, TELE, then special instruction detail 1 cannot exceed 29 characters. If special instruction code 1 = PHONBEN, PHONIBK, TELEBEN, TELEIBK, then special instruction detail 1 cannot exceed 26 characters. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete If special instruction code 1 is null, but special instruction detail 1 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BX | Specical instruction Code 2 | N | X(8) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres. If pay type = TT or CA, valid values are ACC, INS, INT, REC, CONT If pay type = BB, valid values are ACC, BNF, INS, INT, PHON, PHONBEN, PHONIBK, REC, TELE, TELEBEN, TELEIBK, CONT Not valid for pay type = RSPC |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BY | Specical instruction Detail 2 | N | X(33) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres, pay type TT, BB, CA only. If Special Instrcution code2 is null and Special instrcution detail2 is not null, invalid and reject file. If special instruction code2 = ACC, INS, INT, REC, BNF, then special instruction detail 2 cannot exceed 30 characters. If special instruction code2 = PHON, TELE, then special instruction detail 2 cannot exceed 29 characters. If special instruction code2 = PHONBEN, PHONIBK, TELEBEN, TELEIBK, then special instruction detail 2 cannot exceed 26 characters. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete If special instruction code 2 is null, but special instruction detail 2 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| BZ | Specical instruction Code 3 | N | X(8) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres. If pay type = TT or CA, valid values are ACC, INS, INT, REC, CONT If pay type = BB, valid values are ACC, BNF, INS, INT, PHON, PHONBEN, PHONIBK, REC, TELE, TELEBEN, TELEIBK, CONT Not valid for pay type = RSPC |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CA | Specical instruction Detail 3 | N | X(33) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres, pay type TT, BB, CA only. If Special Instrcution code3 is null and Special instrcution detail3 is not null, invalid and reject file. If special instruction code3 = ACC, INS, INT, REC, BNF, then special instruction detail 3 cannot exceed 30 characters. If special instruction code3 = PHON, TELE, then special instruction detail 3 cannot exceed 29 characters. If special instruction code3 = PHONBEN, PHONIBK, TELEBEN, TELEIBK, then special instruction detail3 cannot exceed 26 characters. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete If special instruction code 3 is null, but special instruction detail 3 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CB | Specical instruction Code 4 | N | X(8) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres. If pay type = TT or CA, valid values are ACC, INS, INT, REC, CONT If pay type = BB, valid values are ACC, BNF, INS, INT, PHON, PHONBEN, PHONIBK, REC, TELE, TELEBEN, TELEIBK, CONT Not valid for pay type = RSPC |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CC | Specical instruction Detail 4 | N | X(33) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres, pay type TT, BB, CA only. If Special Instrcution code4 is null and Special instrcution detail4 is not null, invalid and reject file. If special instruction code4 = ACC, INS, INT, REC, BNF, then special instruction detail 4 cannot exceed 33 characters. If special instruction code4 = ACC, INS, INT, REC, BNF, then special instruction detail 4 cannot exceed 30 characters. If special instruction code4 = PHON, TELE, then special instruction detail 4 cannot exceed 29 characters. If special instruction code4 = PHONBEN, PHONIBK, TELEBEN, TELEIBK, then special instruction detail4 cannot exceed 26 characters. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete If special instruction code 4 is null, but special instruction detail 4 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CD | Specical instruction Code 5 | N | X(8) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres. If pay type = TT or CA, valid values are ACC, INS, INT, REC, CONT If pay type = BB, valid values are ACC, BNF, INS, INT, PHON, PHONBEN, PHONIBK, REC, TELE, TELEBEN, TELEIBK, CONT Not valid for pay type = RSPC |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CE | Specical instruction Detail 5 | N | X(33) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres, pay type TT, BB, CA only. If Special Instrcution code5 is null and Special instrcution detail5 is not null, invalid and reject file. If special instruction code5 = ACC, INS, INT, REC, BNF, then special instruction detail 5 cannot exceed 33 characters. If special instruction code5 = ACC, INS, INT, REC, BNF, then special instruction detail 5 cannot exceed 30 characters. If special instruction code5 = PHON, TELE, then special instruction detail 5 cannot exceed 29 characters. If special instruction code5 = PHONBEN, PHONIBK, TELEBEN, TELEIBK, then special instruction detail5 cannot exceed 26 characters. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete If special instruction code 5 is null, but special instruction detail 5 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CF | Specical instruction Code 6 | N | X(8) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres. If pay type = TT or CA, valid values are ACC, INS, INT, REC, CONT If pay type = BB, valid values are ACC, BNF, INS, INT, PHON, PHONBEN, PHONIBK, REC, TELE, TELEBEN, TELEIBK, CONT Not valid for pay type = RSPC |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CG | Specical instruction Detail 6 | N | X(33) | Applicable only for SWIFT payment centres, pay type TT, BB, CA only. If Special Instrcution code6 is null and Special instrcution detail6 is not null, invalid and reject file. If special instruction code6 = ACC, INS, INT, REC, BNF, then special instruction detail 6 cannot exceed 33 characters. If special instruction code6 = ACC, INS, INT, REC, BNF, then special instruction detail 6 cannot exceed 30 characters. If special instruction code6 = PHON, TELE, then special instruction detail 6 cannot exceed 29 characters. If special instruction code6 = PHONBEN, PHONIBK, TELEBEN, TELEIBK, then special instruction detail6 cannot exceed 26 characters. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete If special instruction code 6 is null, but special instruction detail 6 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CH | Remittance Information Code 1 | N | X(4) | For SWIFT payment centres only. If invalid, reject file with \\\"invalid remittance code 1\\\" |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CI | Remittance Information Detail 1 | N | X(140) | If Remittance Information Code 1 = 'Narr' and the length of detail 1 exceeds 140 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 1 = 'INV' or 'ROC' and length of detail 1 exceeds 30 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 1 = 'RFB' and length of detail 1 exceeds 16 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 1 = 'IPI' and length of detail 1 exceeds 20 characters, rejecte file If Remittance Information Code 1 = null and detail 1 is not null, reject file. If invalid swift characters import as incomplete. If Remittance code 1 is null, but Remittance detial 1 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CJ | Remittance Information Code 2 | N | X(4) | For SWIFT payment centres only. If invalid, reject file with \\\"invalid remittance code 2\\\". If Remittance Information Code 1 = 'Narr' and remittance Information code 2 is not null, reject file. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CK | Remittance Information Detail 2 | N | X(33) | If Remittance Information Code 2 = 'INV' or 'ROC' and length of detail 2 exceeds 30 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 2 = 'RFB' and length of detail 2 exceeds 16 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 2 = 'CONT' and length of detail 2 exceeds 33 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 2 = null and detail 2 is not null, reject file. If invalid swift characters import as incomplete. If Remittance code 2 is null, but Remittance detial 2 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CL | Remittance Information Code 3 | N | X(4) | For SWIFT payment centres only. If invalid, reject file with \\\"invalid remittance code 3\\\". If Remittance Information Code 1 = 'Narr' and remittance Information code 3 is not null, reject file. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CM | Remittance Information Detail 3 | N | X(33) | If Remittance Information Code 3 = 'INV' or 'ROC' and length of detail 3 exceeds 30 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 3 = 'RFB' and length of detail 3 exceeds 16 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 3 = 'CONT' and length of detail 3 exceeds 33 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 3 = null and detail 3 is not null, reject file. If invalid swift characters import as incomplete. If Remittance code 3 is null, but Remittance detial 3 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CN | Remittance Information Code 4 | N | X(4) | For SWIFT payment centres only. If invalid, reject file with \\\"invalid remittance code 4\\\". If Remittance Information Code 1 = 'Narr' and remittance Information code 2 is not null, reject file. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CO | Remittance Information Detail 4 | N | X(33) | If Remittance Information Code 4 = 'INV' or 'ROC' and length of detail 4 exceeds 30 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 4 = 'RFB' and length of detail 4 exceeds 16 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 4 = 'CONT' and length of detail 4 exceeds 33 characters, reject file. If Remittance Information Code 4 = null and detail 4 is not null, reject file. If invalid swift characters import as incomplete. If Remittance code 4 is null, but Remittance detial 4 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CP | Instruction Code 1 | N | X(4) | If invalid codewords, reject file. The following rules applies for each pair of instruction codes & instruction code desc: 1. If intermediary bank type is not selected and |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CQ | Instruction Code Desc 1 | N | X(30) | instruction codes 'TELI' or 'PHOI' are selected, import as incomplete. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CR | Instruction Code 2 | N | X(4) | 2. If beneficiary bank type is not selected and instruction codes 'TELE' or 'PHON' are selected, import as incomplete 3. If 'AC' is selected for Payee/Beneficary type |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CS | Instruction Code Desc 2 | N | X(30) | and instruction code 'CHQB' is selected, import as incomplete |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CT | Instruction Code 3 | N | X(4) | 4. If more than 1 instruction codes are selected, they must be in the following sequence: SDVA, INTC, REPA, CORT, BONL, HOLD, CHQB, PHOB, TELB, PHON, TELE, PHOI, TELI. If not in sequence, import as Incomplete. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CU | Instruction Code Desc 3 | N | X(30) | 5. If instruction codes ' HOLD', 'PHOB' or 'REPA', then the corresponding instruction code |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CV | Instruction Code 4 | N | X(4) | description must not be null. If null or invalid SWIFT characters, import as incomplete. 6. If the same code is used more than once, import as incomplete. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CW | Instruction Code Desc 4 | N | X(30) | 7. If instruction codes 'BONL', 'CHQB', 'CORT', 'INTC', 'SDVA' are selected and the corresponding code description is not null, reject file. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CX | Instruction Code 5 | N | X(4) | 8. If instruction code description exceeds 30 characters, reject file. 9. If the following combination of codes are found, import as incomplete: |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CY | Instruction Code Desc 5 | N | X(30) | SDVA with HOLD or CHQB INTC with BONL, HOLD or CHQB |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| CZ | Instruction Code 6 | N | X(4) | REPA with HOLD, CHQB, BONL or CORT CORT with BONL, HOLD, CHQB HOLD with CHQB PHOB with TELB |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DA | Instruction Code Desc 6 | N | X(30) | PHON with TELE PHOI with TELI 10. If invalid instruction code, reject file. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DB | Regulatory Reporting Code 1 | N | X(8) | If invalid, reject file. For STS payment centres, 'Narr' is not valid |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DC | Regulatory Reporting Desc 1 | N | X(105) | For SWIFT payment centres: If Regulatory Reporting Code 1 = 'Narr' and the length of detail 1 exceeds 105 characters, reject file. If Regulatory Code 1 = 'BENEFRES' or 'ORDERRES' and length of detail 1 exceeds 25 characters, reject file. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete. If Regulatory Reporting Code 1 is null, but Regulatory Reporting Detail 1 is not null, reject file For STS payment centres: If Regulatory Code 1 = 'BENEFRES' or 'ORDERRES' and length of detail 1 exceeds 23 characters, reject file. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete. If Regulatory Reporting Code 1 is null, but Regulatory Reporting Detail 1 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DD | Regulatory Reporting Code 2 | N | X(8) | If invalid, reject file. If regulatory reporting code 1 = 'Narr' and regulatory reporting code 2 <> null, reject file. For STS payment centres, only 'CONT' is allowed. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DE | Regulatory Reporting Desc 2 | N | X(33) | If Regulatory Reporting Code 2 = 'CONT' and the length of detail 1 exceeds 33 characters, reject file. If Regulatory Reporting Code 2 = 'BENEFRES' or 'ORDERRES' and length of detail 1 exceeds 25 characters, reject file. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete. If Regulatory Reporting Code 2 is null, but Regulatory Reporting Detail 2 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DF | Regulatory Reporting Code 3 | N | X(8) | If invalid, reject file. If regulatory reporting code 1 = 'Narr' and regulatory reporting code 3 <> null, reject file. For STS payment centres, only 'CONT' is allowed. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DG | Regulatory Reporting Desc 3 | N | X(33) | If Regulatory Reporting Code 2 = 'CONT' and the length of detail 1 exceeds 33 characters, reject file. If Regulatory Reporting Code 2 = 'BENEFRES' or 'ORDERRES' and length of detail 1 exceeds 25 characters, reject file. If invalid SWIFT, import as incomplete. If Regulatory Reporting Code 3 is null, but Regulatory Reporting Detail 3 is not null, reject file |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DH | Sender Charges | N | 9(16,3) | For SWIFT TT only. If overseas charge = C and Sender charges > 0, import as incomplete |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DI | Receiver Charges | N | 9(16,3) | For SWIFT TT only. If overseas charge = P or S and receiver's charges > import as incomplete. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DJ | Cheque no | N | X(16) | For CA & RSPC, if null or invalid SWIFT, import as Incomplete Cannot start with / and cannot have two consecuting // validation added. If failed it will be imported as incomplete. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DK | Cheque Issued Date | N | X(10) | For CA & RSPC, if null or invalid date, import as Incomplete |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DL | Corporate Cheque No | N | X(6) | For CC payment type only, if setup and not provided, import as incomplete |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DM | External Memo | N | X(4000) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if setup for the corresponding STS debit account. English only field |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DN | Mailing Address 1 | N | X(80) | Valid only for TH & IN. Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 80 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DO | Mailing Address 2 | N | X(80) | Valid only for TH & IN. Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 80 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DP | Mailing Address 3 | N | X(80) | Valid only for TH & IN. Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 80 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DQ | Mailing Address 4 | N | X(80) | Valid only for TH & IN. Local language allowed. No invalid SWIFT validation. Not a critical field. If length exceeds 80 characters, file will be rejected. If exceeds the limit allowed for the payment centre, transaction will be imported as 'Incomplete'. Not applicable for SWIFT payment centres. |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DR | Transaction Code | N | X(3) | Applicable for STS' TT and MCPTT txn. Must be 3 characters and only A-Z, 0-9 are allowed |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DS | Custom invoice header 1 | N | X(50) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines the header of the customised invoice |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DT | Custom invoice column alignment 1 | N | X(5) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines whether this column should be left or right align |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DU | Custom invoice column length 1 | N | X(2) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines the width of the column 1 |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DV | Custom invoice header 2 | N | X(50) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines the header of the customised invoice |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DW | Custom invoice column alignment 2 | N | X(5) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines whether this column should be left or right align |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DX | Custom invoice column length 2 | N | X(2) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines the width of the column 2 |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DY | Custom invoice header 3 | N | X(50) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines the header of the customised invoice |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| DZ | Custom invoice column alignment 3 | N | X(5) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines whether this column should be left or right align |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| EA | Custom invoice column length 3 | N | X(2) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines the width of the column 3 |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| EB | Custom invoice header 4 | N | X(50) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines the header of the customised invoice |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| EC | Custom invoice column alignment 4 | N | X(5) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines whether this column should be left or right align |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| ED | Custom invoice column length 4 | N | X(2) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines the width of the column 4 |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| EE | Custom invoice header 5 | N | X(50) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines the header of the customised invoice |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| EF | Custom invoice column alignment 5 | N | X(5) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines whether this column should be left or right align |   | ค่าว่าง |\\n| EG | Custom invoice column length 5 | N | X(2) | Not applicable for SWIFT and AB payment centres. Applicable only if invoice format is A to I. This field defines the width of the column 5 |   | ค่าว่าง