_payment\",\"href\":\"http://wiki.thaisamut.co.th/display/RDSCPENH/tx_batch_payment\"},{\"text\":\"Sample Input_TH\",\"href\":\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1uw6cx84DO_TH1_EAgNWO-DJA68iAWUyq/edit?gid=1471273022#gid=1471273022\"},{\"text\":\"Sample ACH_LBC\",\"href\":\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1zVFhaxwO0IxKig8LCadDlqiC-f0m4E41jqmvPqTpYGI/edit?usp=sharing\"}],\"atts\":[\"/download/attachments/1285096019/image2025-9-19%2016%3A5%3A54.png?version=1&modificationDate=1758272801501&api=v2\",\"/download/attachments/1285096019/image2025-9-19%2016%3A6%3A12.png?version=1&modificationDate=1758272820102&api=v2\",\"/download/attachments/1285096019/image2025-9-19%2016%3A6%3A32.png?version=1&modificationDate=1758272840153&api=v2\",\"/download/attachments/1285096019/image2025-9-19%2016%3A6%3A54.png?version=1&modificationDate=1758272861364&api=v2\",\"/download/attachments/1285096019/image2025-9-19%2016%3A7%3A25.png?version=1&modificationDate=1758272892762&api=v2\",\"/download/attachments/1285096019/image2025-9-19%2015%3A16%3A16.png?version=1&modificationDate=1758269823698&api=v2\",\"/download/attachments/1285096019/image2025-9-19%2015%3A16%3A10.png?version=1&modificationDate=1758269817712&api=v2\",\"/download/attachments/1285096019/image2025-9-19%2015%3A16%3A49.png?version=1&modificationDate=1758269856393&api=v2\"]},{\"id\":\"1271235219\",\"title\":\"Bank Cheque_UOB\",\"url\":\"/display/RDSCPENH/Bank+Cheque_UOB\",\"parent\":\"1267860406\",\"depth\":4,\"status\":200,\"md\":\"| File Type | .txt |\\n|---|---|\\n| Data Padding | Right |\\n| ตัวอย่างไฟล์และคำอธิบาย | [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YaL3g0wfOlgz275ETGmEuv3eKZRt8L-6](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YaL3g0wfOlgz275ETGmEuv3eKZRt8L-6) |\\n\\n| No | Field Name | Length | From | To | Description | Example | Mapping Data |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| **Detail [List]** |\\n| 1 | Transaction Identifier | 3 | 1 | 3 | Fixed as constant value \\\"TXN\\\" | TXN | Fix : TXN |\\n| 2 | P